name: sim.destroyGraphCurve
description: Destroys a graph stream or curve
luaSynopsis: sim.destroyGraphCurve(int graphHandle, int curveId)
pythonSynopsis: sim.destroyGraphCurve(int graphHandle, int curveId)
inputs:
1. graphHandle: handle of the graph
2. curveId: id of the stream or curve, -1 to remove all streams/curves
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: removeTrace, class: graph, file: graph_removeTrace.method
